#: ../../../CHANGELOG.rst:8
msgid ""
"feat: web manager adds \"Discover Plugins\", listing community (GitHub "
"topic ``flask-pluginkit`` repositories) and official (hub API) plugins "
"with installed-version/latest-release detection, upgrade hints and "
"install/upgrade confirmation dialogs; results are cached in memory (8h) "
"and redis (7d)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.rst:9
msgid ""
"change: the official hub API and the GitHub API base URLs are now fixed "
"(``PLUGINKIT_GITHUB_API`` is removed so a compromised mirror cannot serve"
" a malicious plugin list); a new ``PLUGINKIT_PROXY`` config item routes "
"GitHub API requests through an HTTP(S) proxy; pip installs uniformly use "
"``flask_pluginkit.utils.pip_install`` with the "
"``PLUGINKIT_PIP_TARGET_DIR`` target directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.rst:10
msgid ""
"fix: \"Reload Application\" no longer requires ``psutil``; the TEP engine"
" recognizes ``.j2``/``.jinja``/``.jinja2`` templates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.rst:11
msgid ""
"refactor: the web manager compares versions with ``semver`` and uses a "
"unified user-agent for all outbound requests; docs updated."
msgstr ""

