#~ "(``/repos/{full_name}/releases/latest``, cached in "
#~ "memory for 8 hours and queried "
#~ "only when the plugin list is "
#~ "rebuilt). When a newer version than "
#~ "the installed one exists, an upgrade "
#~ "hint is shown and the footer "
#~ "offers an \"Upgrade\" action."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "功能：插件卡片还会显示最新可用版本——PyPI 插件显示来自 PyPI JSON API"
#~ " 的版本，仅 GitHub 插件显示从 GitHub Releases "
#~ "API（``/repos/{full_name}/releases/latest``，内存缓存 8 "
