#~ "标签。当存在比已安装版本更新的版本时，会显示升级提示，页脚提供\"升级\"操作。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "perf: the installed-package detection "
#~ "(``pip list``) is now cached in "
#~ "memory for 5 minutes and invalidated "
#~ "after any install/upload/download action, so"
#~ " repeat listing requests no longer "
#~ "pay the pip subprocess cost even "
#~ "when the plugin list itself is "
#~ "served from cache; ``utils.pip_list`` no "
#~ "longer runs the same ``pip list`` "
#~ "command twice when no target directory"
#~ " is configured."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "性能：已安装包检测（``pip list``）现在在内存中缓存 5 "
#~ "分钟，并在任何安装/上传/下载操作后失效，因此重复的列表请求不再承担 pip "
#~ "子进程开销，即使插件列表本身来自缓存；``utils.pip_list`` 在未配置目标目录时不再重复执行同一条 "
#~ "``pip list`` 命令。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "refactor: version comparison in the web"
#~ " manager uses ``semver`` (declared in "
#~ "``setup.py``) instead of ``packaging`` (an "
#~ "undeclared indirect dependency); all outbound"
#~ " HTTP requests (GitHub Search / "
#~ "Releases / PyPI / hub) now share"
#~ " the ``_USER_AGENT`` header instead of "
#~ "three hard-coded variants."
